            <ArticleTitle>Delayed occurrence of restenosis in drug eluting stents: an evidence of delayed healing.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>483-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Drug eluting stents have made a significant impact on restenosis. However, there are concerns regarding delayed &quot;catch-up&quot; of restenosis. In this case report we present two such patients with delayed occurrence of restenosis after drug eluting stent implantation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
